### 3. Python ML Service (`ml_service`)

#### [NEW] [app.py](file:///c:/Users/sai%20vishwa/Desktop/attendance_env/AI-Interview-Coach/ml_service/app.py)
- A FastAPI/Flask app running at `http://localhost:5000`.
- Provides an endpoint `/api/analyze-frame` that receives webcam frame blobs and returns facial coordinates, eye-gaze indicators, and emotion scores using OpenCV, MediaPipe, and Scikit-learn.
- Provides `/api/analyze-speech` for speech delivery rate (words per minute) and emotion sentiment.

