## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Build verification: Run `./mvnw.cmd compile` to verify the Spring Boot project compiles successfully.
- Dependency verification: Ensure Vite is initialized and all frontend packages compile.

### Manual Verification
- Launch the Spring Boot backend (`./mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run`).
- Launch the React frontend (`npm run dev`).
- Run the ML service (`python app.py`).
- Walkthrough the flow: Sign up -> Log in -> Upload Resume -> Start Technical/HR Interview -> Speak answers -> Review feedback dashboard.
